window.EN={"1":"Roy swears to always protect Lilina, who is devastated by her father's death","2":"But facing the enemy nation Bern's wyvern knights closing in from behind,","3":"at this rate, they won't be able to fight properly...","4":"So Roy and the others, guided by Lilina, set out to obtain the \"Divine Weapon\" first","5":"and headed to a cave on the outskirts of Ostia.","6":"That cave, at the foot of a volcano, would give Roy and his companions a great trial.","7":"B-boss, this is bad! An army's invading this cave!","8":"What!? How many are there?","9":"Dunno. Hope it ain't that many...","10":"That's strange...","11":"The Lycian lords shouldn't have time to be bothering with the likes of us.","12":"What do we do, boss?","13":"This must be their first time in this cave.","14":"They definitely don't know a damn thing about this place.","15":"Lure 'em onto the floor where the magma spouts and finish 'em off.","16":"Roy, this way! Beyond this valley of magma,","17":"the \"Divine Weapon\" passed down through generations of House Ostia should be kept.","18":"Lilina, are you alright? Have you calmed down a little?","19":"Yes... I can't say I'm completely fine, but now isn't the time to be grieving.","20":"Whether we can protect Ostia or not - I'll do my best, for Father's sake too.","21":"I see... That's the Lilina I know.","22":"Because you're by my side, Roy... I can keep from hanging my head.","23":"Huh? Did you say something just now?","24":"No, it's nothing.","25":"Anyway, let me tell you what I've been taught about the \"Divine Weapon\".","26":"What's here is the sword used by Roland the Hero, one of the \"Eight Generals\".","27":"That person - could it be the Roland who was Ostia's first lord?","28":"That's right, our ancestor. The sword's name is Durandal, the \"Blazing Blade\".","29":"Durandal... what a strange-sounding name.","30":"So Roland the Hero fought dragons with that sword during the \"War Between Man and Dragon\", huh?","31":"That's what's been passed down, yes.","32":"After the War Between Man and Dragon, Roland returned to his homeland of Ostia,","33":"and held the Blazing Blade high toward the heavens.","34":"The land, ravaged by war, the natural order that had been thrown into disarray-","35":"all of it, he's said to have restored to its proper form.","36":"Somehow, that's an amazing sword.","37":"After all, it works against dragons. It must hold some mysterious power.","38":"Yeah... by the way,","39":"they say a band of thieves has made this place their hideout - will it be alright?","40":"? What do you mean?","41":"It's not like Durandal's already gone or something, right?","42":"No need to worry. The way to draw out Durandal","43":"should only be known by Roland's direct descendants.","44":"Well, that makes this simple, then.","45":"Let's defeat them and get our hands on Durandal!","46":"Geez... what business do you lot have coming all the way out here?","47":"Well, since you've gone and come here... guess I can't let you go back.","48":"Gah... I knew it...","49":"Roy, I found it, it's this!","50":"So this is Durandal, the \"Blazing Blade\"... it's a really big sword. Looks like it'd be picky about who can use it.","51":"But according to the records, Roland the Hero was a small-built person.","52":"Whether you can use it or not probably depends on your skill with the blade, don't you think?","53":"So if I improve my skill, does that mean even I could use it?","54":"Probably, yeah.","55":"\"Probably,\" huh...","56":"Hehehe...","57":"Lord Roy, this is terrible! Bern's wyvern knights are outside Ostia Castle!","58":"What!? They're already here?","59":"Kukukuku... so you're the one they call Roy?","60":"Much appreciated, really - defeating those fools Legance and his men for me. Saved me some trouble.","61":"Now then, be a good boy and hand over this Ostia to me.","62":"You must be joking! Like hell I'd let the likes of you-!!","63":"Oh? So you'll fight us then - with that tattered fighting force of yours?","64":"Interesting. I'll crush you thoroughly - just like I did with Lord Hector of Ostia.","65":"Ngh!","66":"That's far enough!","67":"L-Lord Narcian! A large force from the Kingdom of Etruria!","68":"Gah, I can see that just by looking! Why on earth...","69":"I am Perceval, Knight-General of the Kingdom of Etruria.","70":"The other day, through Mage-General Cecilia, a request for protection was made from Ostia to our country.","71":"Therefore, from this moment, Ostia falls under the protection of the Kingdom of Etruria.","72":"Wh-what...!?","73":"Not satisfied? Then we'd be happy to cross swords with you.","74":"Though, I wonder if those imposing wyvern knights of yours alone can handle a force this size?","75":"Y-you are...!","76":"I am Cecilia, Mage-General of the Kingdom of Etruria.","77":"I have ties to this Ostia. I won't let you have your way with it.","78":"Ngh... damn you... damn you!","79":"Lord Narcian, you mustn't lose your temper!","80":"General Perceval is one of the finest commanders in the Kingdom of Etruria.","81":"And with their mage corps joining in, fighting with just us wyvern knights would put us at a disadvantage...","82":"I know that already! Pull back!!","83":"Cecilia, was it? You insolent woman - remember this!","84":"General Roy of the Lycian Alliance, I presume?","85":"Y-yes, sir!","86":"I've been entrusted with the army by the late Marquess of Ostia, our alliance's leader.","87":"I see. Lycia is going through a trial, then. From my king of Etruria as well,","88":"I've been tasked with conveying condolences for the Marquess's death.","89":"I'm grateful for your thoughtfulness.","90":"If not for Etruria's help...","91":"Ostia would probably have fallen under Bern's banner by now.","92":"Thank you very much, truly.","93":"I'm not the one who should receive your thanks. I merely followed my country's decision.","94":"If you want to thank someone, thank the Mage-General who pressed the reluctant king on this.","95":"She... defied the king?","96":"That's right. Reckless, isn't she?","97":"Well then, we can't have both of our generals away from the country too long.","98":"I'll excuse myself here.","99":"Cecilia!","100":"I'll leave the rest to you.","101":"Yes, leave it to me.","102":"Phew... General Perceval... what incredible presence.","103":"Hehehe... looks like you were pretty tense.","104":"Lady Cecilia! It's been a while.","105":"You look a little tired, but you seem well overall, Roy.","106":"Yes, thanks to the Etrurian army, we managed to avoid disaster.","107":"I'm glad we made it in time.","108":"I'm sorry - it sounds like you had to push yourselves hard for us...","109":"No, that's not it.","110":"The request for Ostia's protection from you, Roy, was something that benefited Etruria too.","111":"Benefited...?","112":"Yes, that's right.","113":"Bern's recent actions have been more than we could overlook, wouldn't you say?","114":"Our country wanted to deal with it somehow too, but we hadn't been directly attacked...","115":"But if Bern grows any more powerful than this, the balance of power will be thrown off.","116":"And that's where the request from Ostia came in, right?","117":"That's right.","118":"We just judged it was right and acted on it. You don't need to feel indebted to me, Roy.","119":"I understand.","120":"So there's no need to thank us.","121":"Alright, I won't.","122":"Anyway, please come inside. Come meet everyone in the army.","123":"Heh... in the little while I haven't seen you, you've grown quite sturdy...","124":"Boys really do grow up fast."};
